    "detailed_description": "<h1>Prologue</h1><p><br>When a world ends, a new one is born. In this new realm some souls refuse to fade, clinging to the remnants of their previous world's memories and power as reality gradually takes shape.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(<strong>Wishlists are free</strong> and help my game get more visibility.)</h2><strong>\ud83c\udf1fWishlist Now for Exclusive Updates and Early Access!\ud83c\udf1f</strong></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Spells Dungeon</i> offers a classic roguelike experience with the iconic monsters that every dungeon crawler should have. Each dungeon level offers a unique theme, unique enemies, and a challenging boss fight at the end. Defeat the boss to advance to the next level..           <br>\u2014<i>if you have what it takes</i>.                      .                                                   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975830/extras/5f3d08993379567d03efee7ea530afe4.poster.avif?t=1747439090\" width=609 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975830/extras/5f3d08993379567d03efee7ea530afe4.webm?t=1747439090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>You are a wizard, starting with just a fireball-casting staff. Embark on a journey solo or with up to 4 friends in a cooperative adventure, uncover a deep immersive story with multiple endings that will challenge everything you know.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975830/extras/47dc8c227bdba7d4aa244fa5931fe778.poster.avif?t=1747439090\" width=609 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975830/extras/47dc8c227bdba7d4aa244fa5931fe778.webm?t=1747439090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore randomly generated dungeons with unique items in each run.<br></li><li>Lose everything upon death, making each playthrough a fresh challenge.<br></li><li>No classes, build crazy combos without limitations.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975830/extras/76fbc6b980e1cf056eafe406438d79a0.webp?t=1747439090\" width=16 height=15 /></span><strong><i>  Developer's Note</i></strong>:<br>This game is actively updated by a solo game developer. With each update, expect new items, monsters, and secret easter eggs. I am dedicated to creating games that are not only fun but also worth your time.",
