\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975830/extras/76fbc6b980e1cf056eafe406438d79a0.webp?t=1747439090\" width=16 height=15 /></span><strong><i>  Developer's Note</i></strong>:<br>This game is actively updated by a solo game developer. With each update, expect new items, monsters, and secret easter eggs. I am dedicated to creating games that are not only fun but also worth your time.",
